ROS 2 message and service types for Asterism (Asterism::ROS).

Each .rb file here was generated by Asterism's tools/asterism_msggen.rb
from the ROS 2 Jazzy definition it names. Each file states its package and
the license of that package at its top, and is under the same license as
the definition it was made from:

- Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt): std_msgs,
  geometry_msgs, sensor_msgs, nav_msgs, diagnostic_msgs,
  visualization_msgs (https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces),
  builtin_interfaces, service_msgs, rcl_interfaces
  (https://github.com/ros2/rcl_interfaces) and example_interfaces
  (https://github.com/ros2/example_interfaces). Copyright in these
  definitions belongs to their authors (Open Source Robotics Foundation,
  Inc. and the ROS 2 contributors).
- BSD 3-Clause License (LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause-tf2_msgs.txt, "BSD" in its
  package.xml): tf2_msgs (https://github.com/ros2/geometry2).
  Copyright (c) 2008, Willow Garage, Inc.

The definitions are as distributed with ROS 2 Jazzy. The asterism
repository (https://github.com/ruby-asterism/asterism) keeps the
definitions themselves (tools/ros2_jazzy) and the generator; its own code
